        "title": "Prepare yourself ",
        "text": "Not at all what I was expecting. So much culture but not prepared for the cremations happening everywhere. A guide nominated himself to us, he was at first annoying but then it was good he could share his knowledge. Freaky to see dead bodies being cleansed in the Basmati river, the smoke was from the burning bodies and it was all quite confronting. There was a funeral taking place, the body lit from the mouth to burn is not for the feint hearted to see. \nNot a place for children who are not prepared for what is happening. \nSuch a memorable place to see and it's a must see, just be prepared for a confronting experience ",
